  "content_html": "<div class=\"p-4\"><h1 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-4\">API Reference</h1><p class=\"mb-4\">This page provides complete API documentation for the service.</p><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2\">Endpoints</h2><ul class=\"list-disc pl-5 space-y-2\"><li><strong>GET /api/v1/status</strong> - Service health check</li><li><strong>POST /api/v1/deploy</strong> - Deploy new instance</li><li><strong>GET /api/v1/instances</strong> - List all instances</li></ul><h2 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-2 mt-4\">Authentication</h2><p>All endpoints require Bearer token authentication.</p></div>",
